HST Office: Sheets' ribbon groups fill the shared ribbon height, so their captions sit on the other apps' row.

Gap list G06: with one ribbon height (hst-ribbon-equal-height.patch) Sheets' tab boxes, vertically centred, put the
3 px more half above their groups and their caption row 3 px below Writer's, Slides' and Draw's. They fill the
height now, as Writer's tab boxes do.

